WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:04.930
This is an agent app. It opens tickets, and it asks before it closes one.

00:05.450 --> 00:07.600
How much code is behind it?

00:07.650 --> 00:11.630
Almost none. Bring prompts and tools. Plico handles the harness.

00:12.000 --> 00:14.230
The agent is a few files.

00:15.400 --> 00:17.590
Instructions are Markdown.

00:18.900 --> 00:20.850
Skills are Markdown too.

00:22.200 --> 00:25.800
Tools are TypeScript, with human approval when you need it.

00:27.000 --> 00:30.980
The loop, the approvals, the state, the event log. Already built.

00:31.550 --> 00:33.350
Run npm run dev.

00:33.400 --> 00:35.550
A local Studio comes included.

00:35.600 --> 00:36.900
Chat with your agent.

00:36.950 --> 00:40.800
Inspect tool calls, approve them, and replay each step.

00:43.600 --> 00:45.460
Review the files it writes.

00:46.100 --> 00:48.600
Run scripted tests without a model.

00:48.650 --> 00:50.940
Catch setup issues before you ship.

00:51.300 --> 00:54.480
Bring prompts and tools. Plico handles the harness.

00:54.600 --> 00:58.500
Plico is open source. If it's useful, star it on GitHub.
